# Every image in this repository must come from the bundled demo application,
# which runs on invented data, and is named `art/demo-*`. Captures of any real
# system are ignored on principle: they can carry personal or otherwise
# sensitive data, and once pushed to a public repository the blobs stay
# reachable by SHA even after the file is deleted in a later commit.
/art/screenshot-*
/art/cover.*
/art/*-shot.*
/art/capture-*

/vendor
/node_modules
composer.lock
# `package-lock.json` is committed on purpose, unusual though that is for a
# package that publishes no JavaScript. `resources/dist/mia.css` is committed
# too, and CI fails the build when a rebuild does not reproduce it byte for
# byte. That check is only worth running if the compiler is fixed; otherwise a
# new Tailwind patch reports a difference that says nothing about the source.
.DS_Store
.idea
.phpunit.result.cache
.phpunit.cache
build

# Captures kept for checking rather than for the README. `bin/shots.mjs`
# produces the full set — every composition, both colour modes, both widths,
# with and without a validation error — and only the frames the README uses
# are committed.
/art/verification
